      "text": "revelations received at request of, D&C 66; 68. has received truth, D&C 66:1. has received everlasting covenant, D&C 66:2. needs to repent, D&C 66:3. is called to proclaim gospel, D&C 66:5 (68:7–8). to accompany Samuel Smith, D&C 66:8. to administer to and heal sick, D&C 66:9. is warned against adultery, D&C 66:10. to travel south instead of east, D&C 75:6–8. the Lord is not well pleased with, D&C 90:35.",
